{"id":"ln-l0-u1-04","track":"learner","pass_score":0.8,"title":{"ar":"الحروف: ش ص ض ط","en":"Letters: ش ص ض ط","fr":"Lettres : ش ص ض ط"},"teach":[{"type":"text","text":"Letters 13–16 of 28. Look at the dots: they are what tells many letters apart."},{"type":"letter","ch":"ش","name":"sheen","sound":"sh","note":"Same teeth as س with three dots above.","dots":"three dots above","forms":{"iso":"ش","fin":"‍ش","ini":"ش‍","med":"‍ش‍"},"word":{"ar":"شَمْس","en":"sun"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"ص","name":"Saad","sound":"a heavy, emphatic 's'","note":"A loop with a tail, no dots. Say it deep in the mouth.","dots":"no dots","forms":{"iso":"ص","fin":"‍ص","ini":"ص‍","med":"‍ص‍"},"word":{"ar":"صَبَاح","en":"morning"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"ض","name":"Daad","sound":"a heavy, emphatic 'd'","note":"Same as ص with one dot above. Arabic is called 'the language of Daad'.","dots":"one dot above","forms":{"iso":"ض","fin":"‍ض","ini":"ض‍","med":"‍ض‍"},"word":{"ar":"ضِفْدَع","en":"frog"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"ط","name":"Taa","sound":"a heavy, emphatic 't'","note":"A loop with a tall stem, no dots.","dots":"no dots","forms":{"iso":"ط","fin":"‍ط","ini":"ط‍","med":"‍ط‍"},"word":{"ar":"طَائِر","en":"bird"}}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which letter is called «sheen»?","options":["ض","ط","ش","ص"],"answer":2,"explain":"ش is called sheen.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_p1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What is the name of this letter: ص","options":["Taa","Saad","Daad","sheen"],"answer":1,"explain":"ص is called Saad.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_p2"},{"type":"match","prompt":"Match each letter to its name","pairs":[["ش","sheen"],["ص","Saad"],["ض","Daad"],["ط","Taa"]],"explain":"Look at the shape and the dots.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_p3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"The word ضِفْدَع means:","options":["bird","morning","frog","sun"],"answer":2,"explain":"ضِفْدَع = frog. It starts with ض.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_p4"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which letter makes this sound: a heavy, emphatic 't'","options":["ص","ض","ش","ط"],"answer":3,"explain":"ط (Taa) = a heavy, emphatic 't'.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"How many dots does ص have, and where?","options":["Three dots above","One dot below","Two dots above","No dots"],"answer":3,"explain":"ص has no dots.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What is the name of this letter: ض","options":["sheen","Saad","Daad","Taa"],"answer":2,"explain":"ض is called Daad.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_q3"},{"type":"tf","prompt":"True or false: ش is called \"Saad\".","answer":false,"explain":"ش is called sheen; Saad is ص.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_q4"},{"type":"type","prompt":"Type the name of this letter (in English letters): ط","answers":["Taa"],"explain":"ط is called Taa.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"The word صَبَاح means:","options":["frog","bird","morning","sun"],"answer":2,"explain":"صَبَاح = morning.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which word starts with the letter ض?","options":["صَبَاح","ضِفْدَع","شَمْس","طَائِر"],"answer":1,"explain":"ضِفْدَع (frog) starts with ض.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What sound does ش make?","options":["sh","a heavy, emphatic 't'","a heavy, emphatic 's'","a heavy, emphatic 'd'"],"answer":0,"explain":"ش (sheen) = sh.","id":"ln-l0-u1-04_q8"}]}